    "title": "St. Louis officer dies after medical emergency in training - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kevin S. Held Taylor Harris ,\n4 hours ago\nST. LOUIS – A St. Louis police officer died Wednesday afternoon after suffering a medical emergency during a training exercise.\nPolice sources told FOX 2 that Officer Gregory Triplett experienced a cardiac event.\nTriplett was 58. He was a member of the St. Louis Metropolitan Police Department for nearly 32 years.\nThis is a breaking news story. FOX 2 News will have more information as it comes into our newsroom.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 2.",
